SUMMARY:Groovin' on Grovemont 2026: Datrian and the Family Tree
DESCRIPTION:For Groovin’ on Grovemont\, Datrian will be joined by an all-star lineup featuring Tony Black on bass\, Mike Rhodes on drums\, Duane Simpson on guitar\, and Matt Smith on pedal steel. Together\, the group creates a rich and soulful sound that moves seamlessly from gospel-inspired intensity to laid-back mountain groove\, blending heartfelt songwriting\, improvisation\, and deep musical chemistry.\nDatrian’s music has been described as “Appalachian Soul”\, a sound deeply connected to the musical heritage of the Southern mountains while embracing the healing and communal power of song. Audiences can expect an evening filled with passion\, groove\, storytelling\, and musical connection.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/groovin-on-grovemont-2026-datrian-and-the-family/
LOCATION:Grovemont Park Swannanoa
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
